{"server":"tw","storyId":"main_9_level_main_09-16_end","groupId":"main_9","stageId":"main_09-16","title":"“破曉”","storyCode":"9-18","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_09-16_end.txt","sourceHash":"2e26eedf362fad9b53c0c75165a759c7af0df21074e72891a3aca48d1fcb5cd4","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"21_G6_decisivebattlealley_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"有人說，你在附近看見一個頭上長角的白髮姑娘了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"畏縮的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"長官，我也不知道我見到的是不是你們要找的人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"先說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"畏縮的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"她是不是受了重傷？胸口和肚子這一片，開了個好大的口子——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"說下去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"畏縮的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"她被一個灰頭髮的薩科塔抱著，血淌了一地，那叫一個慘！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"薩科塔？你確定沒看錯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"畏縮的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"長官，我保證沒看錯。在小丘郡，薩科塔可不算常見，要不是她頭上那個圓圓的燈管亮得嚇人，大晚上的我都注意不到呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"他們去了哪裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"畏縮的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"就最後那屋子的樓上，破了窗的那間，剛剛那薩科塔跑得飛快，一下就鑽了進去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"就那裡？這麼近？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"P8，R3，這裡是B9——你們搞什麼呢？！目標就在這個區！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"一小時前和半小時前，你們隊就該搜過這條街上的每一間屋子了，為什麼一直沒彙報？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼玩意兒？一點聲音都沒有！P8，R3，立刻回復！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"*維多利亞粗口*！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"畏縮的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"長官，還有我什麼事嗎？沒什麼事的話我就走了，那個，還有您答應能給我的一點點繃帶......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"繃帶？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"你怕是用不上了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"畏縮的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"您......您這是要做什麼？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"這都是頭領的命令。要怪，就怪你自己看到了不該看的東西——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"畏縮的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"啊啊啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在流行打仗之前還要問名字的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"畏縮的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚......哇......就差一點......我的腦袋就要掉了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你快走吧，我會幫你把這些壞傢伙打跑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"畏縮的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"謝、謝謝......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用謝，這是我們應該做的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"破城矛......是維多利亞士兵！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"快，通知“強盜”長官，這裡還有殘餘的維多利亞部隊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“強盜”？你們鬼魂部隊的人取名字品味都這麼差的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我剛才好像還打趴了幾個嘴裡喊著“囚犯”老大的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"......是你幹掉了P8整支小隊？你......一個？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"可他們有三十個人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們的對手可是維多利亞部隊——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就我一個也一樣。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"列隊！列隊！在這裡圍住她，她只有一個人！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這麼快就重新組織了陣型？還蠻專業的嘛！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"保持陣線！壓上去！注意互相支援！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"敵人衝鋒能力很強，不要和她一對一！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦？想以人數取勝？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別太小看——我的矛！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"咿啊啊啊！怎麼會？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"這瓦伊凡太厲害了，一矛能穿兩個人！讓重裝防禦兵上，其他人回防，趕緊去通知頭領——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"別跑！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"最後一個！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"啊啊啊——該死，怎麼連重裝護甲都頂不住？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"得撤，再不撤就來不及了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，怎麼突然飛起來了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"偷了我們的蒸汽噴射裝置？還是又一波來自其他國家的改裝飛行裝備？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這些敵人的作戰手法和最早出現的那批又不一樣了。鬼魂部隊到底是一支什麼樣的部隊啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是三角鐵能在這裡就好了，我的矛很難打到這麼高的位置欸——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"倒了！有弩手在？不，擊倒敵人的不是弩彈，是......石頭？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，的確不是弩手——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"Outcast單手抱著昏迷不醒的病人，從街道旁邊的空屋裡走出來。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是你幫了我嗎？謝謝！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不客氣，事實上，你也幫了我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我聽說薩科塔都很擅長用銃，沒想到扔石頭也能這麼準！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊哈，抱歉，我的槍火有些顯眼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也對，銃的聲響太不尋常。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的朋友是受傷了嗎？她看起來很不好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她在中午被髒彈擊中了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......對不起，差一點我們就能阻止這場襲擊了。把無辜者牽連進去，真的是一個很大的錯誤。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，現在說這些也晚了，我只想能救幾個人是幾個。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這些敵人是在找你們嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看到他們在一路追殺平民，雖然我急著趕路，但我還是沒法放任不管。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們的惡行會得到清算。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哇！剛才我聽到敵人說，有兩支小隊失聯，我只遇到了一支，另一支原來是你動的手？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好厲害！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你也很不錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，敵人並不只有幾支小隊。他們有一整支軍隊，而且從下午開始，越來越多敵人在湧進來。我們很難守住小丘郡了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不是本地人的話，還是帶著你的朋友先離開這座城市吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"眼下巷子外面全是敵人，你們只能從後面走——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，全堵上了？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"城裡的落石真是異常的多啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"趁他們還沒追來，我會先幫你們清理下擋住後面這條路的碎石——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不撤退？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不會撤退。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我還要穿過城區，去和我的隊友會合。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你要穿過城區？當前滿城都是你的敵人，大部分路也被殘垣封住了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還好，我已經走了一半啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你一個人，打他們這麼多人，倒是一點都不害怕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"害怕嗎？戰場上，我還從沒有怕過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，我蠻擔心的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒見過......一座維多利亞的城市變成現在這樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當林貢斯被維多利亞和它的同盟一起徹底撕成碎片的時候，那座曾是世界之都的巨型城市徹底淪為煉獄，景象遠比眼前慘上百倍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，四皇會戰的勝利在課本上有多輝煌，對高盧人來說就有多殘忍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"維多利亞過去的確做了很多過分的事......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當戰火燒到自己家鄉的時候，才能更真切地感覺到，原來這麼疼啊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"差不多了，就剩下這些橫倒的石柱——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我來幫你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝！能推到一邊就行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，一根柱子倒下了，很容易就會砸到另一根。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小聲嘀咕）也不知道未來會怎麼樣......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不到最後一刻，沒人知道維多利亞會走向何方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，我滿腦子都在想這些，害你抱著人還要幫我一起推柱子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一起推總能更快些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是哦，大家一起幹的話，總還有機會，事情還是能往好的方向發展的吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，老這麼說真是奇奇怪怪的，說到底，沒機會了又怎麼樣？事情一路變得越來越壞又怎麼樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"故鄉變壞了就不是故鄉了嗎？用自己的雙手讓土地重新變得肥沃，這不是每個生活在這裡的人都該做的事嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......最後一根！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"路終於清好啦——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（快，B9剛才發的信標就在這巷子裡！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（後面被落石擋住了，但保險起見，派一小隊繞後！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（其他人守在路口，別讓人出來，長官們馬上就到——）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"又有人來了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"女士，我來擋著，你和你的朋友快走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"恐怕很難走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們說的，下面再來的應該就是敵人的首領，沒普通士兵那麼好對付。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那豈不是更應該快走？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"忘了說——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"逃跑從來不是我的習慣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"來，年輕的朋友，幫我個忙——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"Outcast把懷裡的病人推到了風笛手上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸欸，為什麼這麼重？她真的也是瓦伊凡嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，說一位女士重可不是好習慣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼哈......呃......換作別人還真不一定抱得動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"幸好，我還認識一位朋友，她也是瓦伊凡，並且和你一樣，是很年輕又很堅韌的戰士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是想......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請你把病人帶到雕像東側，交給我的朋友和同事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"告訴他們，我很抱歉，有些事我沒做到。他們知道下面該怎麼做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我再多留一會，等幾個人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“雄辯家”","speakerId":"avg_npc_246","isRemote":false,"text":"就在這裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，長官。呃，您和其他五位長官都來了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“會計”","speakerId":"avg_npc_234","isRemote":false,"text":"情報裡說，他們只有三個人......其中還有一位重傷昏迷著。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"那，隨便哪位長官出動都綽綽有餘了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“會計”","speakerId":"avg_npc_234","isRemote":false,"text":"兩個人，幹掉了三支小隊，並且毫髮無傷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“會計”","speakerId":"avg_npc_234","isRemote":false,"text":"你是想告訴我你們有多垃圾，還是眼前的任務不重要到禁得起再三失敗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"不，我不敢......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“囚犯”","speakerId":"avg_npc_234","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......呼......對手真這麼強？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“雄辯家”","speakerId":"avg_npc_246","isRemote":false,"text":"至少強到你都願意醒過來的地步。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“會計”","speakerId":"avg_npc_234","isRemote":false,"text":"謹慎一些總沒壞處，別忘了，除了身份不明的薩科塔和維多利亞士兵，她也在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“會計”","speakerId":"avg_npc_234","isRemote":false,"text":"被逼到極限的話，她能做到什麼程度，你們心裡有底？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“囚犯”","speakerId":"avg_npc_234","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......我開始期待起來了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"21_G5_victoria_street_n_ruins"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"敵人數量......還在增加！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"隊長，呼叫隊長——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"通訊器還是沒信號......唉！我必須馬上把這姑娘交出去......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重症感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_232","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咦......你醒了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重症感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_232","isRemote":false,"text":"不......不......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒醒啊......但為什麼突然掙扎了起來？是夢見什麼可怕的事了嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"21_I5"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"21_I5"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"21_G5_victoria_street_n_ruins"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幹員碎紙機","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"......快到時間了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幹員碎紙機","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"敵人正在往對面聚集，我們不宜久留。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"簡妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再等等吧，碎紙機大哥，Outcast絕對不是不守時的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幹員碎紙機","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"簡妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你看，那個方向！是不是有兩個人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"簡妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Outcast，我們在這！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"簡妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Out——不，不是她，朝我們衝過來的人是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"簡妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"風笛？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？原來那個很帥的薩科塔女士說的朋友是你？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那正好，來來來，這位受重傷的姑娘應該也是你們的朋友吧？薩科塔女士讓我把她帶給你們——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"簡妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Outcast......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"簡妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她在哪裡？！她是不是出了事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她和我分開的時候挺好的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過她想跟你們道歉，說她有事答應了沒做到，她還說你們“知道下面該怎麼做”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"簡妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"簡妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她說這話的意思是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"簡妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"明明她自己說的，救人之前，要先保全自己！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"簡妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因為只有這樣，才能救更多人，更......多......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"簡妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"簡妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幹員碎紙機","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"簡！你不能去找她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幹員碎紙機","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"女士說了，我們知道該怎麼做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"簡妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我同意這位大哥說的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你相信她嗎？我只和她見了一面，但我信她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我把這姑娘帶出來的時候，一路上打倒了二十多個人，不好說有沒有更多人在後頭追著。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"士兵們都沒什麼大不了的，可要是撞上了那個領頭的術師......相信我，她的實力深不見底。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，接好你們的朋友，然後趕緊走。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"21_I8"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幹員碎紙機","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......這光，怎麼回事？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是爆炸？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不，不可能，沒有任何一種炸彈能在瞬間爆發出這麼強烈的光亮，同時還能讓我們完好無損地站在這裡正常呼吸！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這難道是源石技藝？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可是，這樣在短時間內迸發到極致的源石技藝，施術者也會......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"簡妮","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"簡妮","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"火光......刺破了雲層......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"簡妮","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是不是......雨停了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這火光來自西邊......是剛剛那個巷子口？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"如果不是方向不對勁，我甚至以為天亮了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"簡妮","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......是的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"簡妮","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"天......亮了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"所有人都沒有再開口。\n那道灼穿了天幕的火仍在不屈地燃燒著——\n彷彿在向頭頂遲遲不退的黑暗宣洩著死的怒火，又彷彿在向地上相扶相依的人們訴說著生的絢爛。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這真是我見過......最震撼的破曉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"難怪，她會說太顯眼。哈哈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"簡妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幹員碎紙機","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"簡......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"簡妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......哈，我沒事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"簡妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"碎紙機大哥，時間到了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幹員碎紙機","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"......到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"簡妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"跟奧利弗叔叔說，我們已經......接應到了人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"簡妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——是一名重症感染者。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
